# Chapter 2

# PostgreSQL Architecture

The MOS PostgreSQL implementation is divided into schemas.

```
mos/
│
├── identity
├── memory
├── knowledge
├── graph
├── planning
├── execution
├── communication
├── governance
├── retrieval
├── embeddings
├── documents
├── telemetry
├── cache
├── archive
└── system
```

Each schema represents a Storage Domain.

