# Chapter 4

# Universal Object Model

Every MOS object begins with a common structure.

Conceptual model:

```
mos_object

id
object_type
domain
storage_class
lifecycle_state
created_at
updated_at
version
provenance_id
metadata
```

Every specialized table extends this model.

