# Chapter 20

# Partitioning Strategy

Large tables use partitioning.

Events:

```
memory.events

PARTITION BY RANGE(timestamp)
```

Telemetry:

```
PARTITION BY TIME
```

Documents:

```
PARTITION BY domain
```

