# Chapter 21

# Migration Strategy

MOS uses versioned migrations.

Example:

```
migrations/

0001_extensions.sql

0002_identity.sql

0003_events.sql

0004_entities.sql

0005_facts.sql

...
```

Every schema change is reproducible.

